# =============================================================================
# lege-stdin — Reads all of stdin to end of input.
# =============================================================================
#
# Q-E5 (ruled 2026-10-15): "read" returns all of stdin to EOF; "read line" one
# line without its terminator. The returned text keeps the input's newlines,
# including the last one.
#
# See also: lege, lineam, scribe
# =============================================================================

main {
    let _ all ← read
    print all
}
